// Adversarial stress: Afterimage protocol under maximum chaos dash input — Scatter layout.
//
// The Afterimage protocol spawns phantom breaker images tied to dashing rising-edge
// events: a phantom is created when Dashing begins and must be despawned after its
// phantom_duration expires. This stress scenario hammers that lifecycle from three angles:
//
//   1. Dash-edge saturation: action_prob 0.8 drives near-every-frame dash attempts.
//      The Dashing rising-edge detector must not double-fire on successive frames that
//      both read DashState::Dashing — if it fires on edge AND sustained, phantom count
//      accumulates unboundedly. NoEntityLeaks and BoltCountReasonable catch accumulation.
//
//   2. Phantom breaker uniqueness vs. multi-phantom overlap: if max_active is not
//      enforced across rapid successive dashes, multiple phantom entities co-exist
//      with shared component references, causing stale pointer reads on despawn.
//      NoEntityLeaks catches lingering phantom components after the timer expires.
//
//   3. Perfect-bump phantom bounce grade: when the bolt contacts a phantom breaker,
//      the grade derivation reads phantom_duration to determine timing. If the
//      phantom entity is mid-despawn (timer at 0 but entity not yet removed), the
//      grade read is NaN. NoNaN catches this propagation.
//
//   4. Scatter layout produces irregular bolt trajectories; varied angles mean phantom
//      breakers occupy diverse screen regions. BreakerInBounds and BoltInBounds
//      catch any position corruption from phantom-to-primary state confusion.
//
//   5. ValidDashState guards the primary breaker's state machine — phantom spawn/tick
//      must not corrupt the primary breaker's DashState. BreakerCountReasonable
//      verifies phantom entities are never tagged PrimaryBreaker.
//
// 3000 frames with allow_early_end: false ensures sustained dash pressure across multiple
// node restarts. 16 runs explore diverse Scatter layouts and dash timing patterns.
(
    breaker: "Aegis",
    layout: "Scatter",
    input: Chaos((action_prob: 0.8)),
    max_frames: 3000,
    disallowed_failures: [
        NoNaN,
        BoltInBounds,
        BreakerInBounds,
        BoltSpeedAccurate,
        ValidDashState,
        BreakerCountReasonable,
        NoEntityLeaks,
        BoltCountReasonable,
    ],
    allowed_failures: None,
    debug_setup: None,
    allow_early_end: false,
    stress: (runs: 16, parallelism: 16),
    seed: 7331,
    frame_mutations: [
        (frame: 10, mutation: InjectProtocol(kind_name: "Afterimage")),
    ],
)
